Thank you so much.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:53.510
I-I had fun too.

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:56.170
It's all because of your guide.

00:16:56.170 --> 00:16:56.970
Thanks.

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:59.170
But thats...

00:16:59.170 --> 00:17:01.170
Umm...

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.710
Umm, Yuuto-san.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:16.750
Y-Yes?

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:22.140
I... have a favor to ask of you.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.270
What is it?

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.140
Umm...

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.070
Is it possible we can go out again like today,

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:32.970
on another da– da– da–

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:35.210
I-I understand.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.470
We'll go on a date like this again.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.910
O-Okay!

00:17:44.890 --> 00:17:49.390
<i>I made another wonderful memory with Yuuto-san.</i>

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:57.680
Yuuto's pretty late.

00:17:58.230 --> 00:17:59.840
Where could he be?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:00.930
Oh!

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:14.540
Aww, geez!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.220
What the hell am I doing?

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:23.640
<i>I've already decided, I can't run away any longer.</i>

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:17.250
Nogizaka-san...

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:20.370
Huh?

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:28.170
Amamiya-san?

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:33.120
<i>What was that about?</i>

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:40.780
Shiina?

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:42.510
What's wrong?

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:47.430
I have something important to say,

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:48.970
can you spare some time?

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.670
Shiina, what is it?

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.790
<i>Isn't that Amamiya-san's?</i>

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.660
Amamiya-san? I saw her go out earlier.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.370
I see. Thank you.

00:20:21.880 --> 00:20:23.720
Hey, Yuuto.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:27.190
You know that I was born in Hokkaido, right?

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:30.050
Yes, you were born in Otaru.

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:34.180
Yeah. I had to transfer to Hakujou Academy because of my father's job.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:37.430
At first, you were the only person that I knew.

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:39.890
Oh! How nostalgic.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:41.940
It's been almost a year now.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:44.910
Although it feels like we've been friends longer.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:48.350
I'm glad you feel that way.

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.810
Huh? What is it?

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:54.750
Yuuto... I...

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:59.610
You know... I...

00:21:01.450 --> 00:21:02.540
I've...

00:21:05.050 --> 00:21:07.340
fallen for you...

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:16.170
Sorry for being so sudden, I know it may trouble you.

00:21:16.170 --> 00:21:18.100
Even so, I needed to say it

00:21:18.700 --> 00:21:21.160
while you were in front of me.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:25.060
I want you to look at me as a woman.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:26.180
Shiina.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.820
I love you, Yuuto!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:31.540
From way back, I've always...

00:21:32.340 --> 00:21:33.550
loved you.

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:39.750
Ha-Haruka?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:41.250
Nogizaka-san?
Ha-Haruka?

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:49.830
I'm sorry, but I can't lie to myself any longer.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:53.230
I am <i>in love</i> with Yuuto.

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:07.140
I respect you Nogizaka-san. You're a wonderful friend.

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:13.040
I might not be able to match you, but I can't back down.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:15.860
That's why, I refuse to lose!

00:22:20.180 --> 00:22:23.230
Yuuto, you don't have to answer me now.

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:26.010
Take time to think about it.

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:27.420
Until then!

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:04.690
It won't just end with this

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:11.650
At this rate, we'll have heart-fluttering repeats

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:14.100
With our goodbye technique...

00:23:14.100 --> 00:23:19.970
At this rate, we'll be heroines

00:23:19.970 --> 00:23:22.210
Gently, see you later

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.640
See you later, idiot!

00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:28.830
It may be the end, but I still want to stay in touch

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:29.930
I'm sorry

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:34.210
We carefully utter the forbidden truth

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:37.350
Properly, consecutively, tightly, reasonably, certainly,

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:39.380
give me a love rhythm!

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.040
I want to see you take responsibility!

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:46.160
I won't let it end like this

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:50.690
That unknown letter definitely contains the words "I love you"

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:55.560
Saying goodbye isn't allowed

00:23:55.560 --> 00:24:00.210
From my heart and my lips I say thanks

00:24:00.210 --> 00:24:03.050
As a girl I am happy,

00:24:03.050 --> 00:24:05.550
despite these tears I am happy

00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:10.000
Now, smile and wipe your tears

00:24:10.000 --> 00:24:14.330
while executing this great farewell plan!

00:24:16.100 --> 00:24:17.720
It's been a while, but we've started again

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:21.390
with Shiina Onee-san dropping a huge bombshell!

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:22.490
Geez!

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:24.190
She called him out, now what's going to happen?

00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:26.230
I don't have any choice but to do something about this!

00:24:26.230 --> 00:24:28.590
Wait for me, Ran! I mean Onii-san!

00:24:29.080 --> 00:24:31.030
The next Nogizaka hint is:

00:24:31.330 --> 00:24:32.030
Otaru.

00:24:32.710 --> 00:24:34.030
Otaru?
